      "scope": "Research-only extension of the existing actual metadata/constructor composition with per-VM cell writes and VM-owned root-source observation. Initialized unbound cells, valid independent owners, same-generation VMs, abstract atomic operations and fair completion are premises. Imported constructor catchup failure remains enabled: success requires both VM observations, error grants neither child execution nor scan obligation. Writer precommit failure remains in the original projection. No C weak-memory, moving collector, actual frame maps, same-VM data-race contract, arbitrary attachment/migration/retirement or shared primitive-payload eligibility proof. Finite VM roles are not a host CPU count or a runtime limit. No runtime implementation or native/performance admission."
